{"name": "High Rollers: Dice Drop Duel", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge your friends to fast-paced and mind-bending arcade puzzle action in High Rollers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll into this fresh take on the match-3 arcade puzzle genre which has a variety of modes that suit any play style. Compete against rivals in local and online head-to-head versus modes or take things at your own pace with solo scoring and mission modes. Utilize 3 different ways to score to build mind-blowing chain reactions and bury the competition!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/a23022362bed93aa251653e8d8fb6cdb.apng?t=1786984368\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/a23022362bed93aa251653e8d8fb6cdb.poster.avif?t=1786984368\" width=\"18\"/></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Versus</strong> - Challenge your friends or CPU opponents to one of the versus mode variants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/90558aee91b46b57dfbf8d468982845d.apng?t=1786984368\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/90558aee91b46b57dfbf8d468982845d.poster.avif?t=1786984368\" width=\"18\"/></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Score Attack</strong> - Go for the leaderboard in a variety of solo scoring modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/bd0ca1ec7e58711cf9df9fbbbe58d9f6.apng?t=1786984368\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/bd0ca1ec7e58711cf9df9fbbbe58d9f6.poster.avif?t=1786984368\" width=\"18\"/></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Online</strong> - Make new rivals or challenge friends in the online versus mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/85ac5e2ce1297cb3ef63549a356537eb.apng?t=1786984368\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/85ac5e2ce1297cb3ef63549a356537eb.poster.avif?t=1786984368\" width=\"18\"/></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Mission</strong> - Take on over 100 puzzles and challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/472ce6b8456bc628fb734ba0410922b2.apng?t=1786984368\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/472ce6b8456bc628fb734ba0410922b2.poster.avif?t=1786984368\" width=\"18\"/></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Arcade</strong> - Become a High Roller in this classic arcade-style mode against CPU opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/3977ea6ac323293516bf4f12b3e9f22f.apng?t=1786984368\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096150/extras/3977ea6ac323293516bf4f12b3e9f22f.poster.avif?t=1786984368\" width=\"18\"/></picture></span>\u00a0<strong>Lessons</strong> - Learn everything from the basics to advanced techniques across 30+ lessons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 cl